"DATA","SD09B","SD","","258036.22","664774.28","","5.48","1. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  2. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 1.20m depth.  3. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  4. Due to blowing sands no SPT testing was carried out at 16.50m and between 22.50m and 24.50m.  5. Borehole commenced using sonic drilling techniques to 31.50m producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. Borehole continued using coring techniques from 31.50m to 37.00m using a T2-101 barrel producing a nominal core diameter of 80.7mm with liner. Using water as flush medium.  7. Dual standpipe piezometer (complete with flush protective cover) installed on completion. 19mm shallow installation installed to 15.50m, response zone 1.00m to 15.50m depth. 50mm deep installation installed to 20.00m, response zone 16.50m to 20.00m depth.","37.00","2019-05-29","","","2019-06-03","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
"DATA","SD10","SD","","258103.43","664776.73","","5.17","1. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  2. Inspection pit hand dug to 1.20m depth.  3. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  4. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 120mm diameter.  5. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.","3.60","2019-12-12","","","2019-12-12","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
"DATA","SD10A","SD","","258108.42","664776.97","","5.16","1. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  2. Inspection pit hand dug to 1.20m depth.  3. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  4. 50mm diameter standing piezometer (complete with flush protective cover) installed to 10m depth on completion. Response zone 3.5m to 10m depth.  5. Due to blowing sands no SPT testing was carried out at 18.00m and between 16.50m and 30.00m.  6. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 120mm diameter.","30.00","2019-12-13","","","2019-12-17","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
