"DATA","SDCPT01","SD","","257345.79","665050.46","","4.99","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position scanned with a CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 0.30m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT01 followed on from SDCPT01 on 07/06/2019.","6.00","2019-04-30","","","2019-04-30","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","",""
