"DATA","HEADING","SCPP","SCPP_LFS5","OTHER","2DP","Factor of safety 4 based on cyclic resistance ratio 4 and cyclic stress ratio 2 (Idriss and Boulanger 2008)Sand like: FS = (CRR_4 / CSR_2) * K_sigma * MSF * K_alpha; MSF = 6.9 * exp ( - M / 4 ) -0.058 <= 1.8; K_sigma = 1 - C_sigma * ln ( SigDV0 / RefPress","","1.2","","IN SITU SI",""
