"DATA","HEADING","SCPP","SCPP_MV1","OTHER","2DP","Coefficient of volume change (method 1), mv = 1/M; M is the constrained modulus, and is taken from the Constrained_Modulus_1","m2/MN","0.5","","IN SITU SI",""
