"DATA","HEADING","SCPP","SCPP_RD2","OTHER","2DP","Relative density (method 2, Jamiolkowski et al. 2001), Dr = 100 * (C1 * ln (qt /sig atm)/((sig vo' / sig atm)^0.5)) + C2); For average compressibility: C1 = 0.268 and C2 = - 0.675; For high compressibility and sands of carbonate or calcareous composition:","%","33.45","","IN SITU SI",""
