"DATA","HEADING","SCPP","SCPP_RIG1","OTHER","2DP","Rigidity index for fine grained soils (method 1, Mayne 2001), Ir = exp((C1/M + C2) * ((qt  - sig vo)/(qt - u2)) - C3); Cam clay constant, M = 6 * sin(phi')/(3 - sin(phi')); phi' taken from Effective_Friction_Angle_1","","125","","IN SITU SI",""
