"DATA","BHW01","0.00","6.10","MADE GROUND:  Extremely low strength greyish black sandy SILT with occasional pockets of dark greyish brown fine sand and occasional timber. Very strong hydrocarbon type odour.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","6.10","7.15","Loose dark greyish brown slightly gravelly slightly silty fine to coarse SAND. Gravel is subrounded predominantly medium coarse.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","7.15","8.60","Dense dark blackish brown slightly silty predominantly fine SAND.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","8.60","10.80","Medium dense to dense light yellowish brown slightly silty predominantly fine to medium SAND.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","10.80","14.00","Dense becoming very dense light greyish brown slightly gravelly slightly silty fine to coarse SAND with low cobble content. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to coarse of mixed lithologies. Cobbles are subangular to subrounded of basalt.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","14.00","15.00","Very dense light greyish brown slightly sandy subangular to subrounded fine to coarse GRAVEL of mixed lithologies with low cobble content. Sand is fine to coarse. Cobbles are subangular of mixed lithologies.","501","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","15.00","19.40","Very dense grey gritty GRAVEL with cobbles and boulders. (Driller's description - open-hole drilling and poor recovery coring.)","NOAGSCODEFORSGANDCOBANDBOL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","19.40","20.00","Stiff grey boulder CLAY. (Driller's description, poor recovery coring. Cobbles and boulders recovered, fines likely to have been washed away by drilling.)","NOAGSCODEFORCANDCOBANDBOL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","20.00","21.00","Stiff grey boulder CLAY. (Driller's description, open-hole drilling.)","230","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","21.00","22.00","Firm light grey very gravelly CLAY with medium cobble content. Cobbles are subrounded of mixed lithologies. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to coarse of mudstone.","230","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","22.00","22.70","Very weak to weak grey distinctly weathered MUDSTONE with occasional thin laminations of siltstone. Fractures are horizontal to subhorizontal (0-20°) very closely to medium spaced tight to open clay infill on most surfaces up to 10mm thick. Occasional brown staining.","801","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","22.70","25.00","Medium strong to strong occasionally locally very strong grey partially weathered MUDSTONE with thin laminations of siltstone.","801","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","25.00","25.40","Very weak to weak grey distinctly weathered MUDSTONE with occasional fossils up to 15mm and infilled burrows.","801","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","25.40","26.36","Extremely weak to very weak grey distinctly weathered MUDSTONE with occasional thin laminations of coal. Fractures are subhorizontal 0-5° very closely to medium spaced undulating rough planar rough thin clay infill 5mm. Occasional brown staining.","801","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","26.36","26.71","Very weak to weak light grey distinctly weathered LIMESTONE. Thick clay coating on non intact surfaces and rock surface (up to 15mm).","804","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW01","26.71","28.00","Weak to medium strong light grey partially weathered fine to coarse SANDSTONE with rare infills (1mm) of mud. Fractures are medium spaced planar rough tight to partly open no staining on infill possible drilling induced fractures.","803","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","0.00","7.50","MADE GROUND: Very soft greyish black slightly sandy SILT with occasional timber and leather fragments. Sand is fine to coarse. Strong organic type odour.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","7.50","12.00","Possible MADE GROUND: (Loose to medium dense) Greyish brown slightly gravelly very silty fine to medium SAND. Strong hydrocarbon type odour with oil sheen on surface.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","12.00","16.90","Medium dense to dense greyish brown slightly silty fine to coarse SAND.","401","","SAND","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","16.90","17.50","Stiff to very stiff grey slightly sandy gravelly CLAY with medium cobble content and frequent pockets of sand. Sand is fine to coarse. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to coarse of mixed lithologies including mudstone. Cobbles are subangular to subrounded of mixed lithologies predominantly mudstone.  (Driller notes most of the clay washed away when drilling)","230","","CLAY","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","17.50","17.80","COBBLES (drillers description).","701","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","17.80","19.70","Medium strong partially weathered LIMESTONE with frequent thin laminations of mudstone and siltstone and occasional thin laminations of sandstone with occasional fossils (up to 35mm) and rare burrows. Fractures are subhorizontal (0-20°) very closely to medium spaced undulating rough planar rough partly open to open occasional thin clay infill (up to 5mm thick) and occasional calcite infill no staining.","804","","LIMESTONE","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","19.70","20.60","Weak to medium strong grey partially weathered MUDSTONE with occasional thin laminations of siltstone. Fractures are subhorizontal (0-18°) closely to medium spaced planar rough planar smooth tight to open occasional thin clay infill (up to 5mm) occasional brown surface staining.","801","","MUDSTONE","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","20.60","21.90","Weak to medium strong to strong grey partially weathered MUDSTONE with frequent brown infills of clay (up to 70mm long). Fractures are subhorizontal (0-20°) very closely to medium spaced planar rough planar smooth occasional clay infill (up to 10mm) no staining.","801","","MUDSTONE","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW02","21.90","23.40","Medium strong occasionally locally weak grey partially weathered interbedded MUDSTONE and SILTSTONE with occasional thin laminations of sandstone. Occasional brown sand and mud infills (up to 65mm long). Fractures are subhorizontal (0-12°) very closely to medium spaced planar rough planar smooth tight to partly open occasional thin clay infill (up to 5mm) no staining.","801","","MUDSTONE","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","0.00","5.70","MADE GROUND: Very soft brownish grey mottled brown slightly sandy SILT with timber fragments. Sand is predominantly fine to medium. Very strong hydrocarbon type odour.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","5.70","6.80","MADE GROUND: Very soft brownish grey slightly sandy SILT with frequent gravel sized pockets of sand and occasional leaf fragments. Sand is fine to coarse. Strong hydrocarbon type odour.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","6.80","7.50","MADE GROUND: Very soft brownish grey very sandy SILT with frequent gravel sized pockets of sand and occasional leaf fragments. Sand is fine to coarse. Strong hydrocarbon type odour.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","7.50","13.00","Possible MADE GROUND: (Loose to dense) Dark greyish brown slightly gravelly slightly silty predominantly fine to medium SAND. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to coarse of mixed lithologies including mudstone.","102","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","13.00","15.05","Medium dense light yellowish brown slightly gravelly fine to coarse SAND. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine and medium of mixed lithologies.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","15.05","16.60","Very dense greyish brown slightly gravelly slightly silty fine to coarse SAND with low cobble content. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to medium of mixed lithologies. Cobbles are subangular to subrounded of sandstone.","401","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","16.60","17.00","Very dense light greyish brown very gravelly coarse SAND with medium cobble content. Gravel is subangular to subrounded fine to medium of mixed lithologies. Cobbles are subangular of mixed lithologies.","415","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","17.00","19.50","Cluster of big boulders. Stiff grey boulder clay and large cobbles and boulders. Clay washing away during drilling. (Driller's description - open hole drilling.)","NOAGSCODEFORGCANDCOBANDBOL","","","","","","",""
"DATA","BHW03","19.50","19.90","Stiff grey boulder clay. (Driller's description - open-hole drilling.)","226","","","","","","",""
