"DATA","SDCPT01","0.00","6.00","SD","2019-04-30T00:00","2019-04-30T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","LBlair","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position scanned with a CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 0.30m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT01 followed on from SDCPT01 on 07/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT02","0.00","10.50","SD","2019-04-29T00:00","2019-04-29T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","LBlair","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position scanned with a CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 0.24m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT02 followed on from SDCPT02 on 07/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT03","0.00","6.00","SD","2019-04-10T00:00","2019-04-10T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","ZCockburn","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit predug from GL to 1.20m depth, see CPT03 inspection pit log for sample details from this depth range.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT03 followed on from SDCPT03 on 10/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT04","0.00","6.00","SD","2019-05-09T00:00","2019-05-09T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","LBlair","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 1.00m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT04 followed on from SDCPT04 on 10/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT05","0.00","13.50","SD","2019-05-16T00:00","2019-05-17T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","LBlair","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 1.20m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT05 and CPT05A followed on from SDCPT03 on 04 and 05/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT06","0.00","6.45","SD","2019-05-28T00:00","2019-05-29T00:00","JWood","DB320","","","","","","","","","CDavidson","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Hand excavated inspection pit from GL to 1.20m depth.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT06 followed on from SDCPT06 on 06/06/2019.","","","",""
"DATA","SDCPT07","0.00","10.95","SD","2019-06-04T00:00","2019-06-04T00:00","SWatt","DB320","","","","","","","","","CDavidson","","1. CPT borehole prebored by sonic drilling technique, due to shallow ground obstructions.  2. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  3. Ground surface broken out by hydraulic breaker. No inspection pit carried out due to concrete slab.  4. Could not determine any water strikes due to drilling with water.  5. Borehole drilled using sonic drilling techniques producing a hole of 114mm diameter.  6. On completion, borehole backfilled with bentonite pellets.  7. Cone penetration test CPT07 followed on from SDCPT07 on 11/06/2019.","","","",""
