"DATA","TP03","0.00","0.55","TP","2019-06-07T00:00","2019-06-07T00:00","","Hand tools","","","1.00","0.50","","","","","GDavis","","1. Position checked with Ground Penetrating Radar, CAT and Genny prior to excavation.  2. Pit hand dug in riverside footpath adjacent Windmillcroft Quay residences.  3. No penetration of subsurface hard concrete slab possible with pinch bar etc.  4. Trench backfilled on instruction of Atkins to drillers (before engineer photography possible).  5. Moved westwards to TP03A location to attempt to get beyond concrete layer.","","","",""
